        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice In You</strong> is a roguelike deck builder that uses dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar room and realize you’re trapped in a sealed space with a mysterious girl.<br>The only way to escape is to operate the device in front of you and clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/3f64ebe165b085b9baa226b446a09f86.poster.avif?t=1765538267\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/3f64ebe165b085b9baa226b446a09f86.webm?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/3f64ebe165b085b9baa226b446a09f86.mp4?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice Fusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you can obtain dice with special abilities.<br>Newly acquired dice can be fused with one of your existing dice to create your own powerful custom die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/38a7937195080a9ce968c39ada2995ee.poster.avif?t=1765538267\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/38a7937195080a9ce968c39ada2995ee.webm?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/38a7937195080a9ce968c39ada2995ee.mp4?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Girl’s Emotions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl’s emotions change depending on how you play.<br>Her shifting feelings may end up helping you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/05a497a1425298578f32783212510590.poster.avif?t=1765538267\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/05a497a1425298578f32783212510590.webm?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/05a497a1425298578f32783212510590.mp4?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end together with the girl—<br>and <strong>ESCAPE</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice In You</strong> is a roguelike deck builder that uses dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an unfamiliar room and realize you’re trapped in a sealed space with a mysterious girl.<br>The only way to escape is to operate the device in front of you and clear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/3f64ebe165b085b9baa226b446a09f86.poster.avif?t=1765538267\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/3f64ebe165b085b9baa226b446a09f86.webm?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/3f64ebe165b085b9baa226b446a09f86.mp4?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dice Fusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, you can obtain dice with special abilities.<br>Newly acquired dice can be fused with one of your existing dice to create your own powerful custom die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/38a7937195080a9ce968c39ada2995ee.poster.avif?t=1765538267\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/38a7937195080a9ce968c39ada2995ee.webm?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/38a7937195080a9ce968c39ada2995ee.mp4?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Girl’s Emotions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl’s emotions change depending on how you play.<br>Her shifting feelings may end up helping you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/05a497a1425298578f32783212510590.poster.avif?t=1765538267\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/05a497a1425298578f32783212510590.webm?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189910/extras/05a497a1425298578f32783212510590.mp4?t=1765538267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end together with the girl—<br>and <strong>ESCAPE</strong>.</p>",
